Package: ctepi
Title: Cumulative Treatment Effect (CTE) with partial identification (PI)
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Mauricio", "Toro", , "torocea@uc.cl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Partial identification bounds for causal inference based on the 4-epsilon and 4-eta 
   assumptions for the potential outcomes framework. Inference for the Cumulative Treatment 
   Effect (CTE) and the Average Treatment Effect (ATE) based on the novel possible-world causal
   inference framework.
